Package: ProxLabToolkit
Type: Package
Title: Calibrated Differential Enrichment Analysis for Proximity-Labelling Proteomics
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Xin", "Wang", email = "xin.wang@nationwidechildrens.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Consensus differential-enrichment analysis for proximity-labelling (BioID, TurboID, miniTurbo, APEX)
    mass-spectrometry data. Runs several statistical methods (limma, DEqMS, ROTS, proDA, DEP, MSstats) on one
    normalised matrix with detection-limit-aware imputation, combines them with a correlation-corrected Fisher
    statistic so that error rates stay calibrated, and fuses intensity and spectral-count evidence into a
    per-protein score.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3)
Imports: stats, utils, dplyr, purrr, tidyr, tibble, data.table, readr, limma, DEqMS, ROTS, proDA, DEP, MSstats,
    metap, impute, imputeLCMD, MsCoreUtils
Suggests: qvalue, knitr, rmarkdown
biocViews: Proteomics, MassSpectrometry, DifferentialExpression, Software
URL: https://github.com/gucascau/ProxLabToolkit
